00:22:35.975 --> 00:22:39.160
What everybody in this room
needs to wrap their head around

00:22:39.160 --> 00:22:43.550
is that this device owns the
attention of our society.

00:22:43.550 --> 00:22:45.172
You may be upset about it,

00:22:45.172 --> 00:22:47.470
you might be sad that when you go out

00:22:47.470 --> 00:22:49.600
people aren't talking to each other.

00:22:49.600 --> 00:22:51.680
You can do whatever the fuck you want,

00:22:51.680 --> 00:22:54.300
it doesn't change the fact that this

00:22:54.300 --> 00:22:56.650
has the attention.

00:22:56.650 --> 00:22:59.000
And if you are sitting in this room today

00:22:59.000 --> 00:23:00.920
and you have not figured out how to put

00:23:00.920 --> 00:23:05.370
written words, audio, or
video into the platforms

00:23:05.370 --> 00:23:09.780
that sit on top of this, you
are fundamentally irrelevant.

00:23:09.780 --> 00:23:13.538
Now what you're doing with
your allocation of content,

00:23:13.538 --> 00:23:16.640
and ad spend on Facebook and Instagram

00:23:16.640 --> 00:23:18.970
is the same thing that
happens in real estate

00:23:18.970 --> 00:23:20.860
when somebody knows they need to buy

00:23:20.860 --> 00:23:23.890
or debated to buy something
in a hot up and coming area,

00:23:23.890 --> 00:23:24.723
they don't.

00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:27.180
Their friends did.

00:23:27.180 --> 00:23:28.710
It went up.

00:23:28.710 --> 00:23:29.850
It happened.

00:23:29.850 --> 00:23:33.048
Then they get sad, they get
another chance to invest

00:23:33.048 --> 00:23:35.479
for $150,000 more, but
because they fucked up

00:23:35.479 --> 00:23:38.124
and passed at $150,000
less, they say no again,

00:23:38.124 --> 00:23:42.130
six months later it keeps blowing up,

00:23:42.130 --> 00:23:43.790
now it's up $300,000.

00:23:43.790 --> 00:23:45.860
Now you're like fuck again.

00:23:45.860 --> 00:23:48.390
'Cause you passed twice.

00:23:48.390 --> 00:23:50.620
This is the story of Uber for me.

00:23:50.620 --> 00:23:53.010
I passed on Uber's angel round twice.

00:23:53.010 --> 00:23:54.930
Twice.

00:23:54.930 --> 00:23:57.779
How many people read or have
Crush It, my first book?

00:23:57.779 --> 00:24:01.000
If you go back and look at it,

00:24:01.000 --> 00:24:02.930
I acknowledge in the acknowledgements,

00:24:02.930 --> 00:24:06.960
I thank my family and one
random person, Travis,

00:24:06.960 --> 00:24:09.118
the cofounder of Uber.

00:24:09.118 --> 00:24:11.770
I passed on my one of my best

00:24:11.770 --> 00:24:14.400
business friend's startup twice

00:24:14.400 --> 00:24:17.140
at a $4 million valuation,

00:24:17.140 --> 00:24:18.410
and he was one of my best buds,

00:24:18.410 --> 00:24:20.113
and it went on to become Uber.

00:24:21.090 --> 00:24:25.800
I was writing $25,000 and
$50,000 checks back then.

00:24:25.800 --> 00:24:29.440
If I wrote one of my normal
checks back then into Uber,

00:24:29.440 --> 00:24:32.563
that investment would
have paid me $400 million.

00:24:35.198 --> 00:24:36.810
(crowd grumbling)

00:24:36.810 --> 00:24:38.042
I'm not sad.

00:24:38.042 --> 00:24:39.424
(crowd laughing)

00:24:39.424 --> 00:24:40.653
I'm not.

00:24:40.653 --> 00:24:41.848
I'm being dead serious.

00:24:41.848 --> 00:24:43.153
I don't give a fuck about the money.

00:24:43.153 --> 00:24:44.123
I give a fuck about the
freedom of playing the game.

00:24:45.070 --> 00:24:46.670
Understand if you're a true bred

00:24:47.695 --> 00:24:48.528
entrepreneur in this audience,

00:24:52.224 --> 00:24:53.468
you're not in it for the money,

00:24:53.468 --> 00:24:54.670
you're in it for the game.

00:24:54.670 --> 00:24:56.216
I actually love that I
passed on Uber twice.

00:24:56.216 --> 00:24:57.712
(crowd cheering)

00:24:57.712 --> 00:24:58.810
I'm being serious.

00:24:58.810 --> 00:25:01.370
The quickest tell for me in five minutes

00:25:01.370 --> 00:25:03.160
when I hang with somebody,
if they're a true bred

00:25:03.160 --> 00:25:06.460
or if they're not is are
they in it for the game

00:25:06.460 --> 00:25:08.403
or do they wanna buy a watch.

00:25:08.403 --> 00:25:11.153
(crowd cheering)

00:25:17.493 --> 00:25:19.160
- Thank you so much.

00:25:20.032 --> 00:25:22.195
(crowd yelling)

00:25:22.195 --> 00:25:24.728
- Alright, I gotta go, sorry.

00:25:24.728 --> 00:25:25.561
Love you.

00:25:27.356 --> 00:25:29.875
(crowd cheering)

00:25:29.875 --> 00:25:32.042
(kissing)

00:25:37.646 --> 00:25:40.909
- [Man] So my question to
you really evolves around

00:25:40.909 --> 00:25:42.826
the idea of being young

00:25:44.078 --> 00:25:47.679
and wanting to really do my own thing,

00:25:47.679 --> 00:25:49.982
but (mumbling)

00:25:49.982 --> 00:25:53.482
but realizing that the job that I'm in now

00:25:54.406 --> 00:25:56.600
is an incredible opportunity.

00:25:56.600 --> 00:25:59.387
So I'm loving it, it's not that I hate it,

00:26:00.855 --> 00:26:03.065
it's providing extreme value.

00:26:03.065 --> 00:26:04.504
- I got great news for you,

00:26:04.504 --> 00:26:05.423
you'll never know the alternative
of the one you picked.

00:26:08.160 --> 00:26:10.620
You can't really do both.

00:26:10.620 --> 00:26:12.960
You can flirt with both.

00:26:12.960 --> 00:26:15.210
But you can't put your ass on two toilets.

00:26:15.210 --> 00:26:17.445
And so, you can do things,

00:26:17.445 --> 00:26:20.218
but if you have two businesses,
you have no businesses.

00:26:20.218 --> 00:26:22.089
It's like having two quarterbacks.

00:26:22.089 --> 00:26:26.194
I would tell you

00:26:26.194 --> 00:26:29.240
an unbelievable, liberating feeling,

00:26:29.240 --> 00:26:31.240
that so many of you are struggling with,

00:26:32.430 --> 00:26:33.800
so many people here don't make decisions

00:26:33.800 --> 00:26:35.860
because they're worried about the

00:26:35.860 --> 00:26:36.850
what if of the other decision.

00:26:36.850 --> 00:26:38.570
This is how life actually works.

00:26:38.570 --> 00:26:39.603
You'll never know.

00:26:40.451 --> 00:26:43.440
You will never know if you bounce now

00:26:43.440 --> 00:26:45.590
and go on with your life solo,

00:26:45.590 --> 00:26:47.410
or if you stay another three years.

00:26:47.410 --> 00:26:48.760
You're just not gonna know.

00:26:48.760 --> 00:26:49.993
So why dwell on it?

00:26:51.550 --> 00:26:53.000
Just pick one and fucking go.

00:26:53.943 --> 00:26:56.447
(crowd calling out)

00:26:56.447 --> 00:26:57.347
Thank you brother.

00:26:59.222 --> 00:27:01.163
